---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /stays/
title: Stays
description: "Every place I have slept, browsable by what you want from it. Camping, hotels, rural boltholes, hot tubs, saunas, forest cabins, beaches and pools."
---
{% from "rec.njk" import rec %}

<header class="head">
  <p class="mini">{{ atlas.totals.stays | pl("stay") }} · {{ atlas.totals.types | pl("type") }}</p>
  <h1 class="head__title">Stays</h1>
  <p class="head__lede">Browse by what you actually want out of a place rather than by which country it happens to be in.</p>
</header>

<section class="band">
  <div class="band__head"><h2 class="band__title">By type</h2></div>
  <div class="recs">
    {%- for t in atlas.types %}
    {{ rec(t.name, t.url, t.stayCount | pl("stay"), "from " ~ (t.fromPrice | money), t.blurb) }}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="band__head">
    <h2 class="band__title">Everything, best first</h2>
    <p class="band__note">Scored out of five on one question: would I tell someone else to go?</p>
  </div>
  <div class="recs">
    {%- for s in atlas.stays | sortByRating %}
    {{ rec(s.name, s.url, s.placeName ~ ", " ~ s.countryName, s.price | money, "", s.rating ~ "/5") }}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
